fig(p,'ablation',14,'Table 3',[132,228,495,322],'Table 3:','Measure the effect of the physics penalty','Compare with/without PDE rows across all three datasets.','The regularizer improves lesion metrics, but its incremental contribution is smaller than the complete method comparison.')
